From 5e7b58a4edba02d75b7089fce97fdd291945cbe7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:35:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CR5: the look pool is real and saved; the creator offers deep
 parts (lashes, eyelids, eyeliner)

The pool (look_pool.c) is 6,144 B (384 B on the PS1), keeps the old run when a put does not fit,
and has emit / load / reset. The creator's save chunk (version 2) carries it after the gene
trailer (CR3), so old saves load with an empty pool and the slot registry stays at 14. A new
RK_DEEP row kind edits the draft's pool-backed deep fields (undo ring, reset, copy, randomise);
write_town stores the run before it touches the town and refuses a full pool (Wardrobe full).
town_free drops a citizen's run. Lashes, eyelids and eyeliner (9 painted values, reviewed on the
slot sheets) are live, with icons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvvRYHgPW3b8GJby1n
